{"headword":"מִשְׁנֶה²","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.</strong> [<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>double, copy, second</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:43\" href=\"/Genesis.41.43\">Gn 41:43</a> +; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִשְׁנֵה</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 16:18\" href=\"/Jeremiah.16.18\">Je 16:18</a> + 3 times, so read also <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 15:18\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.15.18\">Dt 15:18</a> (van d. H., > -<span dir=\"rtl\">נֶה</span> Gi), <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 17:18\" href=\"/Jeremiah.17.18\">Je 17:18</a> (Gie Buhl al.); sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִשְׁנֵהוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 8:2\" href=\"/I_Samuel.8.2\">1 S 8:2</a> +; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִשְׁנִים</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 15:18\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.15.18\">1 Ch 15:18</a> (<a data-ref=\"I Samuel 15:9\" href=\"/I_Samuel.15.9\">1 S 15:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 1:10\" href=\"/Ezra.1.10\">Ezr 1:10</a>. v. infr.);—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"(the) <em>double:</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">כֶּסֶף מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 43:12\" href=\"/Genesis.43.12\">Gn 43:12</a> (J) <em>money of double amount</em>, cf. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, כֶּ֫סֶף\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_כֶּ֫סֶף\">מ׳ כֶּסֶף</a> v <a data-ref=\"Genesis 43:15\" href=\"/Genesis.43.15\">15</a> (J), <em>a double amount</em> (in) <em>money</em> (Ges<sup>§ 131q</sup>); <span dir=\"rtl\">לֶחֶם מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 16:22\" href=\"/Exodus.16.22\">Ex 16:22</a> (P); <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ עַל אֲשֶׁר וגו׳</span> v <a data-ref=\"Exodus 16:5\" href=\"/Exodus.16.5\">5</a> (P) <em>the double above what</em> they gathered daily; <span dir=\"rtl\">מִשְׁנֵה שְׂכַר שָׂכִיר</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 15:18\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.15.18\">Dt 15:18</a> (v. Dr); <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ עֲוֹנָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 16:18\" href=\"/Jeremiah.16.18\">Je 16:18</a> <em>the double of their guilt</em>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 17:18\" href=\"/Jeremiah.17.18\">17:18</a> (v. supr.); <em>a double portion</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 61:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.61.7\">Is 61:7</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 9:12\" href=\"/Zechariah.9.12\">Zc 9:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 42:10\" href=\"/Job.42.10\">Jb 42:10</a>."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"written <em>copy</em> of law <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 17:18\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.17.18\">Dt 17:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 8:32\" href=\"/Joshua.8.32\">Jos 8:32</a> (D)."}],"num":"2."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>second</em> in order:"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>second rank</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מִרְכֶּבֶת הַמּ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:43\" href=\"/Genesis.41.43\">Gn 41:43</a> (J), <span dir=\"rtl\">רֶכֶב הַמּ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 35:24\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.35.24\">2 Ch 35:24</a>; of pers. <em>one second in rank</em>, priest next to high-priest, <span dir=\"rtl\">(הַ)מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 23:4\" href=\"/II_Kings.23.4\">2 K 23:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 25:18\" href=\"/II_Kings.25.18\">25:18</a> = <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 52:24\" href=\"/Jeremiah.52.24\">Je 52:24</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶהְיֶה־לְּךָ לְמ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 23:17\" href=\"/I_Samuel.23.17\">1 S 23:17</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מִשְׁנֵה הַמֶּלֶךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 28:7\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.28.7\">2 Ch 28:7</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ לַמֶּלֶךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Esther 10:3\" href=\"/Esther.10.3\">Est 10:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 15:18\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.15.18\">1 Ch 15:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 16:5\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.16.5\">16:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 31:12\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.31.12\">2 Ch 31:12</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ מֵאֶחָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:17\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.17\">Ne 11:17</a>.—<a data-ref=\"I Samuel 15:9\" href=\"/I_Samuel.15.9\">1 S 15:9</a> read (cf. 𝔖 𝔗) <span dir=\"rtl\">הַמַּשְׁמַנִּים</span> (<a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 8:10\" href=\"/Nehemiah.8.10\">Ne 8:10</a>) Th, <span d